 "sponsor": "Rep. Espaillat, Adriano [D-NY-13]",
 "official_summary": "<p><strong>Holcombe Rucker Park National Commemorative Site Act</strong></p><p>This act designates Holcombe Rucker Park, in Harlem, New York, as the Holcombe Rucker Park National Commemorative Site. The act also allows the Department of the Interior to enter into&nbsp;cooperative agreements with appropriate entities (e.g., New York City) for interpretive and educational purposes related to the site.</p>",
